    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "One chance, two chances of three",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Think I got too much sympathy, yeah",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I hold my grudges like I held you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "How does me tryin' to fix it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Turn into \"I'll just forgive it\"?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "One chance, two chances were lost on you (Uh)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You can only dig the grave so deep",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Before you start to take me down with you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "With you, with you, with you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I could never make you want me like I wanted to be wanted",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I could never really change you like I thought that I could",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I was tryna make us somethin' out of nothin', we were nothin' at all",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You can only dig the grave so deep",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You can only try to save somethin' that's not already gone",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's so sad, what the fuck?",
