          "text": "I'm crazy if I called you, right?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Tables turned, now I'm out",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And you just called, like, thirty times (Thirty times)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Always a funny thing",
